"I have acquired a crow-lich familiar" width="400px" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <h3><span>From <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xilascrowe" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2969291&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606983586" alt="XilasCrowe" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2969291)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xilascrowe" >XilasCrowe</a></span></span></h3> <h3><span>SCP-3911</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="border: 1px solid #000;"> <div style="height: 100%;"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/malycegraves-author/SCP-3911_1.jpg" title="SCP-3911" alt="SCP-3911" width="400px" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <h3><span>From <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/luxaiko" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5963620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606983586" alt="Luxaiko" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5963620)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/luxaiko" >Luxaiko</a></span></span></h3> <h3><span>Sarkic-esque Smoke Deity</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;image</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" hr