&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black&quot;&gt;Dr. James Otavka, Medical Director of Site 226, is hereby promoted to Level 4 security clearance and named Interim Site Director of Site 226.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black&quot;&gt;All non-essential activities, including but not limited to academic classes, experimentation, D-class termination, and off-site leaves, are to be temporarily cancelled pending review by Interim Site Director Otavka.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
